@startuml
title Strict compatibility：Academic Pipeline mid-entry
skinparam shadowing false
start
:User provides goal and existing material;
:Agent inspects registered evidence;
:CLI instructions expose the entry graph;
:Start confirmed mid-entry subflow;
if (Accepted workflow_branch Decision?) then (research)
  :Enter research;
elseif (write)
  :Require trusted synthesis_report;
  :Enter write;
elseif (pre-review)
  :Require trusted paper_draft;
  :Enter pre-review integrity;
else (revision)
  :Require trusted review_report;
  :Enter revision round;
endif
:Continue through normal profile;
note right
  Material Passport may be imported only with this strict Start
  and remains non-authoritative evidence.
end note
stop
@enduml
